type: software
title: "RISC-V-Based Fault-Resilient INT8 AI Accelerator"
authors:
  - family-names: "Hassan"
    given-names: "Md Shahariar"
    email: "346ronokarya@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ronok-shahariar/riscv-resilient-ai-accelerator"
url: "https://github.com/ronok-shahariar/riscv-resilient-ai-accelerator"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  A research-oriented PicoRV32-based RISC-V system integrating a custom signed
  INT8 multiply-accumulate accelerator through memory-mapped I/O, with
  simulation testbenches and automated verification. Fault-resilience and FPGA
  implementation are planned stages, not yet verified results.
